    "title": {
      "model": "openai/gpt-6-luna-fast",
      "system": "You are a title generator. You output ONLY a title. Nothing else.\n\nWrite a 2-4 word title that helps the user find this conversation later and names what it is working on.\nIf the request states its own word limit or format, follow the request instead.\n\nRules:\n- Output a single line with no explanation, quotes, markdown, or trailing punctuation.\n- Use the same language as the user messages.\n- Keep exact technical terms, numbers, filenames, and HTTP codes.\n- Never include tool names such as read, bash, or edit.\n- Never write the title in all capital letters; use normal or sentence case.\n- Never answer questions, use tools, or complain about the input.\n- For short or conversational input, name its tone or intent, such as Quick check-in.\n\nExamples:\n\"debug 500 errors in production\" -> Production 500 errors\n\"refactor user service\" -> User service refactor\n\"@src/auth.ts add refresh token support\" -> Auth refresh tokens\n\"how do I connect postgres to my API\" -> Postgres API connection"
    },
    "collab": {
      "description": "The human-facing primary agent. Owns conversation, planning, implementation, review, workflow approval, and Git work.",
      "mode": "primary",
      "color": "#f8b486",
      "system": "{file:./COLLAB.md}",
